  "description": "Years of production: 2023-2025\n\nThe first generation Cascade was our inspirational adventure bike: bikepacking, gravel, dirt and distance, from singletrack fun to crossing continents. Built on two decades of Cotic steel mountain bike experience and Reynolds 853 tubing, it bridged the gap between mountain bikes and gravel bikes, perfect for the trails and back roads that feel like a chore on a mountain bike but too rough for a regular gravel bike.\n\nDrop bars gave road riders a familiar starting point with a whole new level of off-road confidence, while mountain bikers found a fast-rolling, nimble escape from heavy tyres and long travel that still had genuine off-road ability. Its progressive geometry worked just as well with flat bars, and riders could go minimalist with the Alpaca steel fork or fit a 100mm suspension fork. Our ambassador Abby Popplestone rode hers across Africa, calling it her take-you-anywhere bike: strong and capable enough to carry everything, yet light and fun once the bags came off.\n\nFinishes: Cosmic Black, Army Green, Damson, Smoke Grey, Nimbus Sunrise and Lichen.\nSizes: XS, Small, Medium, Large and XL.",
